# Host agent binaries stay out of the context except the linux-x64 pins: the
# cloud image needs exactly those, and carrying host-prefetched copies lets the
# in-container ensure steps skip large downloads on flaky networks (they still
# hash-validate; missing copies fall back to downloading as before).
apps/claude-code-bin
!apps/claude-code-bin/linux-x64
apps/codex-bin
!apps/codex-bin/linux-x64
apps/ripgrep-bin
!apps/ripgrep-bin/linux-x64
apps/pi-bin
!apps/pi-bin/linux-x64
!apps/pi-bin/linux-x64/**
apps/android-platform-tools-bin
